wyze-view (0.2.0) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Per-camera recording with Record All / Stop All and per-camera
    auto-record (record = true in cameras.toml).
  * Rolling size-capped recording files; fixed
    <name>-<start>_<stop>.mkv naming; recordings browser that plays
    clips in mpv.
  * ffmpeg is now a required dependency.

